{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f PRESENTATION\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Night of the Stars</strong> is a 2D exciting RPG full of secrets and sidequests in the style of Aldorlea games such as <i>Millennium</i> or <i>Dreamscape</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f SUMMARY\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 888 years in Faust, it's the \u2606 Night of the Stars \u2606</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've been chosen by your community to reach out for the 3 Half-Gods and stop the ever-expanding Void from swallowing every life form. Your salvation lies in the joint power of the Half-Gods. But will they even want to collaborate with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a Destroyer and a Chaos among their ranks, nothing is less certain. You'll have to use not only your might, but also your wits. Past records of history, now almost forgotten, have proven it's not a given, and the Champion sometimes struggle to reach his goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you have to succeed. There is no other option. And you only have 24 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because tonight is not your ordinary day... for you and everyone else, it's the Night of the Stars! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f FEATURES\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Visible Enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Mouse Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Autosave after each battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Evolving &amp; Strategic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 A lot of interactivity and many secrets rewarding exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 2 Different Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 5 modes of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 15-20 hours of playtime </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 15 secret rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 21 sidequests (+ main quests)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 21 unique relics to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 50+ enemies</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1694860?t=1739225817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1694860?t=1739225817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739225817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739225817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3344600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f PRESENTATION\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Night of the Stars</strong> is a 2D exciting RPG full of secrets and sidequests in the style of Aldorlea games such as <i>Millennium</i> or <i>Dreamscape</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f SUMMARY\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 888 years in Faust, it's the \u2606 Night of the Stars \u2606</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've been chosen by your community to reach out for the 3 Half-Gods and stop the ever-expanding Void from swallowing every life form. Your salvation lies in the joint power of the Half-Gods. But will they even want to collaborate with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a Destroyer and a Chaos among their ranks, nothing is less certain. You'll have to use not only your might, but also your wits. Past records of history, now almost forgotten, have proven it's not a given, and the Champion sometimes struggle to reach his goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you have to succeed. There is no other option. And you only have 24 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because tonight is not your ordinary day... for you and everyone else, it's the Night of the Stars! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u272f FEATURES\u00a0\u272f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Visible Enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Mouse Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Autosave after each battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 Evolving &amp; Strategic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 A lot of interactivity and many secrets rewarding exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 2 Different Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 5 modes of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 15-20 hours of playtime </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 15 secret rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 21 sidequests (+ main quests)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 21 unique relics to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2726 50+ enemies</p>","developers":["Aldorlea Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1694860/header.jpg?t=1739225817","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256842650,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256842650/movie480.mp4?t=1738924942","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2568